    <node id="Mr. Creed">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Creed</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A companion of the Narrator who accompanies him back to the house and to the Towre, where they speak for ammunition.&lt;SEP&gt;Person whose £10,000 imprest bill was signed for the forthcoming voyage.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Creed is a man who dined with the narrator and later went with the narrator to a tobacco shop.&lt;SEP&gt;Person ordered by My Lord to imprest money on The Narrator, with payment to be made by Alderman Backwell.&lt;SEP&gt;The writer of a letter dated 15th July who reports that My Lord has recovered from pain and fever and expects to go aboard.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-037</data>
