      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Place Pepys visited by water to inspect ships and from which Pepys and companions walked to Redriffe.&lt;SEP&gt;Place reached by barge from Whitehall where The Narrator boards the Dutch Yacht.&lt;SEP&gt;The place where Samuel Pepys and the two Sir Williams went to examine the delays in getting ships ready.&lt;SEP&gt;The place where Sir G. Carteret invited officers to dinner.</data>
