    <node id="Mr. Townsend">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Townsend</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An officer connected with the Wardrobe whose possible death is discussed as a contingency in arranging the Wardrobe business.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Townsend is a man ordered by My Lord to reveal the whole mystery of the Wardrobe to the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;Person at The Wardrobe willing to communicate anything for My Lord's advantage concerning My Lord's business.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Townsend is a friend who was present at the Wardrobe for Lord of Sandwich's birthday and who was called after dinner.&lt;SEP&gt;A man who dines in a merry company with his wife, receives a call from Captain Cooke, and goes with the Narrator and Captain Cooke to a tavern.</data>
