    <node id="Sir W. Batten">
      <data key="d0">Sir W. Batten</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Sir W. Batten was a contemporary of Samuel Pepys and a frequent participant in the diarist’s social life. He hosted numerous gatherings at his house, including a Sunday dinner after church, at which Pepys and other guests were present; a post-theater evening where Pepys and companions stayed late; and a gathering with Pepys, the Comptroller, and Mr. Mills, who sat late talking and disputing. Batten also hosted a convivial occasion where Pepys and others ate a venison pasty and were merry. Pepys often visited and sat with Batten at his home, indicating an ongoing personal acquaintance.

Batten had several notable interactions with Pepys beyond dining. On one occasion, Batten left in the morning with Lady Batten to keep Whitsuntide, and Pepys took leave of him. That same night, Pepys borrowed £40 from Batten. Batten also waited alongside Pepys on the Duke of York, showing his involvement in court or official business. Pepys sought Batten at the Dolphin tavern and later found him there; on another occurrence, Batten was found at the Dolphin, where Pepys and Sir W. Pen joined him. Pepys also visited Batten at his house with wine. Additionally, Batten’s home was the destination when Pepys and others were called to see the great baboon that Captain Holmes had brought from Guiny. Thus, Sir W. Batten appears as a host, acquaintance, and occasional lender to Pepys within the diary’s social and professional circles.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-042</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788445826</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
