      <data key="d2">A doctor who goes over to the Beare at the Bridge Foot with the Narrator in the morning, expecting to meet Lord Hinchinbroke.&lt;SEP&gt;A companion who goes with the narrator to the Beare at the Bridge Foot and later to the Wardrobe.</data>
