      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A nobleman whom the Narrator and Dr. Peirce think they will meet at the Beare at the Bridge Foot.&lt;SEP&gt;A nobleman planning to set forth for France with a brother; the departure is postponed because Lord Abbot Montagu is not in Paris.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-002</data>
