    <node id="The Wardrobe">
      <data key="d0">The Wardrobe</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Wardrobe was a royal office and department in London, staffed by officers such as Mr. Townsend and Mr. Young, whose business followed the instructions of My Lord. It also functioned as the London residence of My Lord and My Lady—understood to be the household of Edward Montagu, Earl of Sandwich—and served as a frequent setting for meals, visits, and family events in the diary of Samuel Pepys.

As a building, The Wardrobe was where My Lady lived and where Pepys often dined with her, sometimes accompanied by Dean Fuller, Dr. Thomas Pepys, or others. He also dined there with Mr. Moore, Ned Pickering, and Sir Robert Slingsby; on one occasion he arrived too late, dining with the servants before going to My Lady. It was a place reached by water, where Pepys met his wife, found My Young Lord ill, took leave of Lord Hinchingbroke and his brother before their trip to France, and learned that Lady Sandwich and her child were well. The Wardrobe hosted the celebration of the Earl of Sandwich’s birthday, and there Pepys and his wife visited My Lady when she lay confined to bed. The narrator also spent the night at The Wardrobe after calling there with Sir Robert Slingsby. It was thus both an official workplace and the central domestic hub of the Sandwich household, where Pepys conducted social, family, and administrative business throughout his diary.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-045&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-047</data>
