    <node id="Mr. Holland">
      <data key="d0">Mr. Holland</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A man in Bridewell to whom the diarist owes money and whose house the diarist and Captain Lambert visit.&lt;SEP&gt;Mr. Holland is a man living in Bridewell whom the narrator visited; the narrator owed him money and his wife and mother were present.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-004</data>
