      <data key="d0">Mr. Pierce's Wife</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wife of Mr. Pierce. The Diarist sat with Mr. Pierce's Wife for a good while at Mr. Pierce's residence; she is described as continuing very pretty.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-005</data>
