    <node id="Lisbone">
      <data key="d0">Lisbone</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Portuguese port city, written as Lisbone, to which My Lord is to return with three ships to meet the fleet following My Lord.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-006</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788445848</data>
