    <node id="Captain Ferrers">
      <data key="d0">Captain Ferrers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Person who accompanies The Narrator into a wherry after the yachting party departs.&lt;SEP&gt;The captain whose lady or wife was part of the merry company that ate a good venison pasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Captain Ferrers is the man whose lady was mentioned among the friends present at the Wardrobe for Lord Of Sandwich's birthday.&lt;SEP&gt;A captain who was taken by the narrator with two young gentlemen and two ladies to the Theatre.&lt;SEP&gt;A captain who accompanies the diarist to the Theatre to see The Alchymist.&lt;SEP&gt;A man who accompanied the narrator to the Opera, saw The Witts, and drank at the Devil Tavern.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-038</data>
