      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The wife of The Narrator; one of The Narrator's Wife's petticoats was used to make a coat that The Narrator wore on the 13th.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator's Wife is the woman who met the Narrator at the Wardrobe on Lord of Sandwich's birthday.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator's wife, who hired the chambermaid and informed the narrator about Mrs. Hater's labor.&lt;SEP&gt;The wife of the narrator who went with Mr. Hater because his wife was in labour.&lt;SEP&gt;Wife of the narrator; accompanies Lady Sandwich's children by coach, dines at the narrator's father's house, and visits Mrs. Cordery.&lt;SEP&gt;Wife of the narrator; rides by coach with the narrator to Uncle Fenner's house.</data>
