    <node id="Westminster Hall">
      <data key="d0">Westminster Hall</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A hall the diarist visited with Mr. Moore during term time.&lt;SEP&gt;Hall in Westminster where the diarist walked during term time and spoke with Roger Pepys.&lt;SEP&gt;The hall in Westminster where the narrator talked with Mrs. Michell.&lt;SEP&gt;The hall at Westminster where the diarist stayed talking with Mrs. Michell.&lt;SEP&gt;Westminster Hall is the hall in Westminster where Parliament's adjournment was expected to be announced and where the Narrator spoke with Mr. George Montagu in the lobby.&lt;SEP&gt;A hall The Narrator visits where The King is expected to come and adjourn Parliament.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-028</data>
