    <node id="The Exchange">
      <data key="d0">The Exchange</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A building the diarist went to at night to meet Uncle Wight.&lt;SEP&gt;The place over against which the ordinary stood.&lt;SEP&gt;A place Samuel Pepys visits at night before meeting Uncle Wight at the Mitre.&lt;SEP&gt;A place visited by the Diarist at noon, where he met Uncle Wight.&lt;SEP&gt;A place where bills related to the Navy were offered for sale.&lt;SEP&gt;The London financial venue where the Navy's bills are offered for sale at 20 in the 100 loss.&lt;SEP&gt;The building where the Narrator meets Dr. Williams by appointment.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-046</data>
