    <node id="Dr. Williams">
      <data key="d0">Dr. Williams</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A doctor who came to see Pepys's wife and dined at an ordinary with Pepys and Pepys's father.&lt;SEP&gt;A doctor whom the narrator and the narrator's father go to see but do not find at home.&lt;SEP&gt;A man visited by the narrator and the narrator's father; Dr. Williams signs a copy of an uncle's will and later dines with the narrator at a cook's shop.&lt;SEP&gt;An acquaintance who meets the Narrator at the Exchange and discusses Aunt Pepys's £200 bond.</data>
