      <data key="d0">Diarist's Uncle</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Uncle of the diarist; reported by the father of the diarist to have fits of stupor, drunk-like states, and occasional speechlessness.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-017</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788445866</data>
