      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Royal official who receives L20,000 under the King's warrant, receives L5,000 out of money voted by the Parliament of Ireland, receives another L20,000 to clear a mortgage on Clarendon Park, and is impeached by the Commons.</data>
