    </edge>
    <edge source="Narrator" target="The Office">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Narrator was called away from his guests to the Office, stayed a little, and then returned home.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator resumed sitting at the office in the morning and did business there.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator spent the morning at the Office, though there was little to do.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator was at the Office in the morning and did business.</data>
