    <edge source="Narrator" target="Tom">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The narrator takes Tom to the Bear Tavern and gives Tom wine.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom is the brother of the narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator and Tom worked together with the narrator's father to settle matters and cast up the narrator's father's accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator fears Tom will miscarry for want of brains and care.&lt;SEP&gt;Tom is the Narrator's brother.</data>
