    <edge source="Narrator" target="The Wardrobe">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">After leaving the Beare, the narrator goes with Dr. Peirce to the Wardrobe and learns about the changed travel plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Narrator went to The Wardrobe for dinner, met My Wife, and found My Young Lord ill.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator went with the narrator's wife to the Wardrobe to see My Lady.</data>
