    <edge source="Narrator" target="Pall">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Narrator and his wife took Pall by water through the bridge, showed her the ships, and brought her to the Narrator's house.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator told My Father that the Narrator intended not to keep Pall longer for certain reasons, which troubled My Father and the Narrator.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator angrily told Pall that he would keep her no longer.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator, in anger before the narrator's father, told Pall that Pall would be kept no longer, and later made an end with Pall because Pall troubled the narrator.</data>
