    <edge source="The Wardrobe" target="The Diarist">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Diarist twice went to The Wardrobe, first with My Wife and later with W. Howe.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diarist went to The Wardrobe for dinner with My Lady.&lt;SEP&gt;The diarist went to The Wardrobe after visiting Mr. Edward Montagu and dined there.&lt;SEP&gt;The diarist went to the Wardrobe but came too late and dined with the servants.&lt;SEP&gt;The diarist walked from Paul's to the Wardrobe to dine with My Lady.</data>
