    <edge source="The Narrator's Father" target="The Narrator">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Narrator's Father is the father of the Narrator and takes part in the estate discussions at Goody Gorum's.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator is the child of the Narrator's Father; the Narrator returned to Brampton to join the Father and tried to appear cheerful in the Father's presence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator's father perceived that The Narrator had been drinking, which The Narrator's father had never seen or heard before.&lt;SEP&gt;At Brampton The Narrator found The Narrator's father very well and later went home to The Narrator's father.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator's father came to the narrator's house, and the two discussed business.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator's father came to the narrator's home for dinner and was merry with Dr. Tom Pepys.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator meets The Narrator's Father by appointment and shares a morning drink before leaving to visit Dr. Williams.</data>
      <data key="d9">dined with,family,father,found,met,noticed,parent_of,perceived,son,visited</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf47789c7f6b678113755e09e7199138-chunk-041</data>
