      <data key="d8">The Narrator's Aunt is the aunt of the Narrator and is the subject of the will dispute.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator's side agreed to give Aunt L10, upon which she is to quit the house.&lt;SEP&gt;The Narrator's Aunt is the aunt of the Narrator; the Narrator observed the Aunt continuing in base, hypocritical tricks.&lt;SEP&gt;As part of the agreement, L10 was to be given to the narrator's aunt.</data>
