      <data key="d8">The narrator called at the house of My Lady on the 22nd.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator went to My Lady's house and dined with My Lady.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator went to the Wardrobe for dinner, where My Lady was merry and well.</data>
